}
```

**Response syntax, upon failure:**

```json
{
  "error": {
    "message": "<MESSAGE>",
    "type": "<TYPE>",
    "code": <CODE>,
    "error_data": {
      "messaging_product": "whatsapp",
      "details": "<DETAILS>"
    },
    "error_subcode": <ERROR_SUBCODE>,
    "fbtrace_id": "<FBTRACE_ID>"
  }
}
```

